From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:07:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: share an engine between both inputs by turns

vdin1 carried one input per stream, so a screen read and a video read
restarted it on every switch. The Hyperion feed beside a video capture
got a few frames a second each, or one of them starved, by start order.
---
